+/**
+ * @file
+ * Assorted DPCM (differential pulse code modulation) audio codecs
+ * by Mike Melanson (melanson@pcisys.net)
+ * Xan DPCM decoder by Mario Brito (mbrito@student.dei.uc.pt)
